## Purpose
With this PR, developers can pass the configurations related to underlying http listener, when creating a websubhub listener without using the http listener configs.

## Samples
```ballerina
import ballerina/websubhub;

websubhub:ListenerConfiguration configs = {
    secureSocket: {
        key: {
            path: "ballerinaKeystore.pkcs12",
            password: "test123#"
        }
    }
    
    // any additional configurations related to http-listener 
};

service /hub on new websubhub:Listener(9090, configs) {
    // resources
}
```
Fixes [#1056](https://github.com/ballerina-platform/ballerina-standard-library/issues/1056)

